<title>POLAND: GORAZDZE APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 9.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>GORAZDZE APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 9.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     9.31 vs   3.37</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 9.39 vs   3.41</p>
<p> Operating profit     7.95 vs   2.78</p>
<p> Sales		   26.88 vs  17.36</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     6.47 vs   2.45</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.55 vs   2.50</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.52 vs   3.31 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   64.00 vs  43.80</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish cement maker is Gorazdze SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
